	-- plural, as words: Frostmaul Giants = {npc:7428} Frostmaul Giant · Hederine Slayers = {npc:7463} Hederine Slayer
	["New in Forever: this guide follows what players did on {area:616}. If a step is wrong, tell us on Polestar's Discord or GitHub and name the step.\n{area:616} lies south of {zone:1452}. Fly to {area:2255} (from Theramore on the Alliance route; the Horde route already ends there), bind your Hearthstone at the inn (partway through this guide {npc:256222} sends you to {area:493}, and the way there starts in {area:2255}), then ride south down the road through {area:2249} and on through {area:2256}, which leads up into {area:616}.\nCareful: elites stand along the whole way in. Frostmaul Giants and Preservers (59-60) flank the road through {area:2249}, and Hederine Slayers, Initiates and Manastalkers (57-58) line {area:2256} from its mouth to the zone line, with {npc:10201} (61) on its east side. Follow the arrows' line at full speed, never stop or fight on the way, and don't turn off it."] = "Nuevo en Forever: esta guía sigue lo que hicieron los jugadores en {area:616}. Si un paso está mal, avísanos en el Discord o el GitHub de Polestar e indica el paso.\n{area:616} está al sur de {zone:1452}. Vuela a {area:2255} (desde Theramore en la ruta de la Alianza; la ruta de la Horda ya termina ahí), vincula tu piedra de hogar en la posada (a mitad de esta guía {npc:256222} te manda a {area:493}, y el camino hasta allí empieza en {area:2255}), y luego baja al sur por el camino que cruza {area:2249} y sigue por {area:2256}, que sube hasta {area:616}.\nCuidado: hay élites a lo largo de todo el camino. Gigantes y valedores Machacahielo (59-60) flanquean el camino por {area:2249}, y Destripadores, Iniciados y Acechamaná Hederine (57-58) bordean {area:2256} desde su entrada hasta el límite de la zona, con {npc:10201} (61) en su lado este. Sigue la línea de las flechas a toda velocidad, no te detengas ni pelees en el camino y no te desvíes.",
