	["{npc:254915}, at the Summit, for {npc:263406}'s message."] = "{npc:254915}, en la Cumbre, por el mensaje de {npc:263406}.",

	-- Step 139: The Summit's Blackthorne quests
	["The Summit's Blackthorne quests"] = "Las misiones Puanegra de la Cumbre",
	-- {npc:260674} Ve'han Talongrasp
	["A group stop: the Blackthorne camps north-east of the Summit hold elite Outrunners, Priests and a Courier (60) as often as the Cultists and Adepts, with {npc:260674} (60, elite) in the middle and Ghansurok (61, elite) on the ridge. Grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. Skip these if you are alone."] = "Una parada para grupo: en los campamentos Puanegra al noreste de la Cumbre hay avanzados, sacerdotes y un mensajero élites (60), tanto como cultores y adeptos, con {npc:260674} (60, élite) en el medio y Ghansurok (61, élite) en la cresta. Se recomienda ir en grupo; busca gente con quien hacerlas. Si vas solo, omítelas.",

	-- Step 140: Fly to the Tainted Foothills
	-- {npc:260626} Bluebell · {npc:249235} Kaylaena Springwhisper · {npc:256222} Ketharas
	["Fly down to {npc:260626} for {npc:249235} and {npc:256222}."] = "Vuela abajo hasta {npc:260626} por {npc:249235} y {npc:256222}.",

	-- Step 141: Kaylaena Springwhisper's workshop
	["North to the workshop. Turn the two gears and connect the two battery terminals on both sides of her glaive thrower. Ghansurok, the elite chimaera (level 61), prowls around the workshop: watch for him while you work."] = "Al norte, hasta el taller. Gira los dos engranajes y conecta los dos bornes de batería a ambos lados de su lanzaguja. Ghansurok, la quimera élite (nivel 61), ronda el taller: vigílala mientras trabajas.",

	-- Step 142: Ketharas
	["South-east to the Hermit's Abode with what the wild gods and Omnuron gave you."] = "Al sureste, hasta la Hermit's Abode, con lo que te dieron los dioses salvajes y Omnuron.",

